{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46955","headline":"[溪]居寓言 · 齐己","name":"[溪]居寓言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋蔬数壠傍潺湲，颇觉生涯异俗缘。\n诗兴难穷花草外，野情何限水云边。\n虫声遶屋无人语，月影当松有鹤眠。\n寄向东溪老樵道，莫催丹桂博青钱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}